### Design Rationale Summary:

| Task | Rule Type | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| find iron_ore | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → player must face the target. Target at [4,1,-5], max_distance=16 covers room, facing_tolerance=60° requires deliberate look. |
| mine mossy_cobblestone_wall | inventory_has | Mine task → mined item ends up in inventory. Mossy cobblestone wall drops itself when mined with any pickaxe. |
| craft to orange_stained_glass | inventory_has | Craft task → crafted item ends up in inventory. Recipe: 8 glass + 1 orange dye = 8 orange stained glass. |

All milestones follow the preference order (inventory_has for mine/craft, position_near_with_facing for find), use appropriate parameters verified against the scene layout, and have descriptions explaining both what is checked and why that rule type was chosen.
